  "short_description": "《Blind Descent》是一款深入火星地底未知領域的開放世界生存冒險遊戲。可單人遊玩，也可與好友進行4人合作模式，一同尋找失蹤的隊伍。透過打造自訂工具、升級基地，以及/或是在這個詭譎的異星世界中讓自身產生變異，以適應環境並求得生存。",
  "short_description_en": "Blind Descent is an open-world survival adventure into the mysteries of the Martian depths. Play solo or with friends in 4-player co-op as you search for the missing team. Adapt to survive by building custom tools, upgrading your base, and/or mutating in this bizarre alien world.",
